      "note": "The path comes from Track#path or Album#cover_path, but it never reaches send_file raw: MediaFile resolves it through symlinks and rejects it if it falls outside the media root, before anything is opened. Brakeman sees the model attribute and not the guard. Covered by test/models/media_file_test.rb (.., absolute paths, siblings with the same prefix, symlinks that escape) and by the integration test that expects 403."
